where Co is the initial concentration and Ce is the equilibrium concentration (mg/L) of MB in the bulk phase. The symbol w represents the amount of liquid phase (L) while m is the weight of the adsorbent (g). The adsorption kinetics model was calculated using the Pseudo First Order32 and the Pseudo Second Order as given in Eqs. (2) and (3)33, respectively.

